data:{"type":"ACTIVITY_SNAPSHOT","runId":"r1","threadId":"canvas-1786758854-1","timestamp":1786758923122,"messageId":"a2ui-aug-sales-research","activityType":"a2ui-surface","content":{"a2ui_operations":[{"version":"v0.9","createSurface":{"surfaceId":"aug-sales-research","catalogId":"https://opencode-agui-app.local/a2ui/data-agent-catalog.json"}},{"version":"v0.9","updateComponents":{"surfaceId":"aug-sales-research","components":[{"component":"Text","id":"title","text":"八月销售研究","variant":"h3"},{"component":"Badge","id":"meta","text":"2 节","variant":"info"},{"component":"Text","id":"sec-0-h","text":"关键发现","variant":"h4"},{"component":"Markdown","id":"sec-0-md","text":"- **总销售额：1,360,700 元**（8/1–8/13，138 条销售记录）\n- **最高区域：华北 388,082 元**（占比 28.5%），其次华东 366,096（26.9%）、华中 285,225（21.0%）、西南 171,346（12.6%）、华南 149,951（11.0%）\n- **最高品类：笔记本 615,912 元**（占比 45.3%），其次手机 347,913、平板 228,712、智能手表 112,425、耳机 55,738\n- 笔记本为绝对主力：品类占比接近一半，是驱动整体大盘的关键\n- 头部区域集中度高：华北+华东合计贡献超 55% 销售额"},{"component":"Column","id":"sec-0-col","children":["sec-0-h","sec-0-md"]},{"component":"Card","id":"sec-0","child":"sec-0-col"},{"component":"Text","id":"sec-1-h","text":"趋势观察","variant":"h4"},{"component":"Markdown","id":"sec-1-md","text":"- **峰值日 8/8：168,261 元**，为全月单日最高，主要由笔记本大单拉动（华北、西南笔记本当日合计约 9.1 万）\n- **低谷日 8/11：53,079 元**，为全月唯一跌破 6 万的交易日，较峰值日下滑约 68%\n- 整体走势：月初 8/1 偏低（86,683）后 8/2 快速回升至 12 万+，8/8–8/9 冲顶，之后中旬明显回落至 5–10 万区间\n- 8/4（56,572）与 8/11 为两个明显洼地，可回溯当日是否缺货、缺活动或渠道投放问题"},{"component":"Column","id":"sec-1-col","children":["sec-1-h","sec-1-md"]},{"component":"Card","id":"sec-1","child":"sec-1-col"},{"component":"Column","id":"root","children":["title","meta","sec-0","sec-1"]}]}}]},"replace":true}

